s, Pros and Cons, Best Practices, and Pitfalls","excerpt":"Git submodules let you embed one Git repository inside another and pin it to a specific commit. This guide (as of 2019-05-30) covers when submodules shine, where they hurt, practical workflows, best practices, and common pitfalls-so you can decide if they're the right tool for your project.","status":"published","tags":["Web Development","Version Control Systems","Git","GitHub","Best Practices","Software Development","Software Engineering","Collaboration","Monorepo"],"slug":"git-submodules-use-cases-pros-and-cons-best-practices-and-pitfalls"},{"author":"Paul Serban","date":"June 08, 2019","excerpt":"New to GitHub? Learn the fundamentals of version control, repositories, pull requests, and collaboration with this in-depth beginner's guide to GitHub.","pinned":false,"status":"published","subheading":"Getting Started","tags":["Web Development","Version Control Systems","Git","GitHub","GitFlow","GitHub Pages","Documentation"],"title":"GitHub: Basics","slug":"github-getting-started"},{"author":"Paul Serban","date":"June 13, 2019","excerpt":"Discover the advanced capabilities of GitHub Pages-from powering blogs and documentation to hosting static web apps with site generators like Jekyll, Hugo, and Gatsby","pinned":false,"status":"published","subheading":"Static Site Generators, Blogs, Documentation Sites, and Web Applications","tags":["Web Development","Version Control Systems","Git","GitHub","GitFlow","GitHub Pages","Hosting","SSG","Documentation"],"title":"GitHub Pages: Advanced Uses","slug":"github-pages-advanced-uses"},{"author":"Paul Serban","date":"June 11, 2019","excerpt":"Learn how to set up and host your website for free using GitHub Pages. Discover how developers use GitHub's static site hosting to deploy professional sites with ease","pinned":false,"status":"published","subheading":"A Simple and Free Way to Host Your Website","tags":["Web Development","Version Control Systems","Git","GitHub","GitHub Pa